==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Kaijin Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*5 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Master A.]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Malizabeth]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
**5 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~14 seconds<sup>400f~420f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 7.33 seconds<sup>220f</sup>, delay 13.33~14 seconds<sup>400f~420f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 13.33~14 seconds<sup>400f~420f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Spam [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cats]] with [[Scarf Cat (Special Cat)|Red Nyanko Rangers]], [[Ribbon Cat (Special Cat)|Pink Nyanko Rangers]], and [[Helmet Cat (Special Cat)|Yellow Nyanko Rangers]] to overwhelm the Master A. [[Giga-Nyan Rex (Uber Rare Cat)|Giga-Nyan Prime DX]] is somewhat inconsistent, but helps speed things up if it lands a hit.

